{
  "_comment": [
    "One short scripted route per game for tools/regress/run_regress.ps1 (docs/REGRESSION.md).",
    "Every run starts from a fresh import of anyx/<id>.anyx: a new profile, no saves, the first-run screens.",
    "seconds: how long the game runs (from its start). input: ANYX360_INPUT (seconds from the first input poll).",
    "input_clock: ANYX360_INPUT_CLOCK (frames:<fps> counts the game's frames). nui: the scripted Kinect player",
    "(ANYX360_NUI_SCRIPT, actions separated by commas). shots: screenshot times (seconds from the start).",
    "phases: windows (seconds from the start) whose frames/p99 are summarised and compared; probe: the phase",
    "whose p99 tells whether the machine is steady (Mortal Kombat's and Gears' menus). title: the window's exact",
    "title (null: the first 'AnyX360 - ' window of the game's processes, reported). settings: extra lines for",
    "the sandbox settings.toml (every player's device is \"none\": scripted input only, never a real pad).",
    "dlc: the packs the .anyx holds."
  ],
